:: Final Confrontation

# The Final Choice

You stand before the breach -- the tear in reality that has been poisoning Thornwood for fifty years. The Amulet of Thornwood glows in your hand, resonating with the rift's energy.

<<if $maras_secret_known>>
Mara's voice echoes in your memory: "The amulet is the key to ending this."
<</if>>

<<if $garrett_betrayed>>
Garrett's warning surfaces: "Mara's hiding something. Watch your back."
<</if>>

You know the truth now. The amulet can seal the breach forever -- or it can be used to widen it, granting tremendous power to whoever holds it. Roderick died trying to seal it. Mara has lived with the guilt for fifty years.

### Choose Your Fate

''Seal the breach'' -- Use the amulet to close the rift forever. Thornwood will be safe, but the amulet will be consumed. You'll be remembered as a hero.

[[Seal the breach|Ending Seal]]

''Claim the power'' -- Use the amulet to widen the breach and absorb its energy. You'll gain immense power, but Thornwood will be consumed by the curse.

[[Claim the power|Ending Power]]

<<if $intelligence >= 13>>
''Find a third path'' -- Your intelligence suggests there might be a way to seal the breach without destroying the amulet. A ritual that requires both the amulet and the willing sacrifice of one connected to the original catastrophe.

[[Attempt the ritual|Ending Ritual]]
<</if>>
